  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "talk_bram/hello/l1",
      "speaker": 1,
      "text": [
        "You're the new hand? Odile said you'd be quick. Are you quick?"
      ],
      "at": {
        "file": 1,
        "line": 14
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "talk_bram/hello/l2",
      "speaker": 1,
      "text": [
        "The lamp's lit already! Was that you? It doesn't matter. It's lit."
      ],
      "cond": 2,
      "goto": {
        "line": 13
      },
      "at": {
        "file": 1,
        "line": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "talk_bram/hello/l3",
      "speaker": 1,
      "text": [
        "The Wren is out there. My dad's boat. Two lamps on this coast and one of them is ours."
      ],
      "cond": 3,
      "at": {
        "file": 1,
        "line": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "talk_bram/hello/l4",
      "speaker": 1,
      "text": [
        "The light held, didn't it? I watched it from here. It held."
      ],
      "cond": 4,
      "at": {
        "file": 1,
        "line": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "talk_bram/hello/l5",
      "speaker": 1,
      "text": [
